# um-texts 1
=== briefing D55
Release the girl
#show Hero 1
#show Deva 2
#ANIMATION 72
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Deva  1
Stop! One more step and I will call for the Lords of the Dungeons - and you will die a horrible death!
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
I think I am lost... Merciful heavens, how beautiful she is!
#DESC Speaks like he is charmed
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Deva  3
What, are you so frightened you cannot utter a word? I knew my kidnappers were but a bunch of cowards!
#ANIMATION 45
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  4
And her voice! I could listen to it for hours... Oh... wait a minute, what did she say?
#DESC Still with charmed voice, then comes to his senses and continues worriedly 
#ANIMATION 72
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Deva  5
And your mistress Diera is just a miserable two-faced creature who lies in her sleep!
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  6
Hold, Princess, hold! I am not what you think I am! I am not in Diera's employ, on the contrary, I just fought with her mercenaries! I have come through this cave to save you!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Deva  7
You? But who are you? And how did you know I was here?
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  9
I was sent by the Great Magician Tka-Rick... But it is a long story. I will tell you everything. But first I must recover from the journey through the cave!
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Deva  10
All right. But please do not call me Princess. My name is Lu-a-Jalla, and I would like to forget that that stupid nickname.

=== briefing D55_1
About the Brigands and the cave
#show Hero 1
#show Deva 2
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  1
When you thought I was a Brigand you said you would call the Lords of the Dungeons for help. Did you mean Wormheads? Can you really control those horrible creatures?
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Deva  4
No, I cannot give them orders... Wormheads simply respect the treaty they have made with the Joons in ancient times. The decline of our race, the disaster which fell upon the world - the Lords of the Dungeons do not care about all that. They simply keep their word.
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Deva  5
That is why I was able to escape from the Brigands' subterranean camp without pursuit... they were scared! So I was surprised and scared when you came in here, even though I was not alone.
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  6
It was not easy. And by the way, I hope you know how we can get out of this cave? A teleport spell will take us back to Tka-Rick, but it will only work for the two of us. What about the one who remains here?
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Deva  7
Oh, that is easy. The Lords of the Dungeons know by now that all my visitors are trustworthy.
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  8
Excellent! Now could you give me a few minutes? I have to say goodbye...

=== briefing D55_2
Go to Gipath
#show Hero 1
#show Deva 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  1
And now get ready - we are going to be teleported to a powerful Magician, the one whom you believed to be a fairy tale character. In a few seconds you will meet him. Let us go!

=== briefing D55_3
About the Great Magician and the quest
#show Hero 1
#show Deva 2
#ANIMATION 30
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Deva  1
Tka-Rik... that was the name of a Magician in one of the fairy tales I heard in my childhood! That Magician sleeps in a cave on a remote island, and when he awakes the good times will return... but somehow I do not think the actual reality will be anything like the tale!
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  2
Oh do not be so sure... mayhap they do have something in common. Tka-Rick does live in a cave in a remote land, and he does want to bring the good times back. That is why I am here - my mission was to find you.
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
I accomplished my mission and now I am happy. Not because the Magician will be pleased with me - however great he may be - but because I met the most beautiful and delightful girl in the world!
#ANIMATION 40
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  5
I swear I shall think of no other woman from now on, and I swear I... Oh, Merciful heavens... I am lost for words!
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Deva  6
Please do not say such things, I beg you. You saved me and I like you... But I do love someone else and I will never betray him even if he is far away!
#ANIMATION 43
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  7
How dared he abandon you? I think he is just a coward, and if our paths ever cross he will be sorry!
#ANIMATION 73
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Deva  8
Do not dare speak about At-Zako like that! We narrowly escaped the Curse of Joons together. You cannot imagine the horror of that...family and friends dead, one after the other, empty homes, bloody footprints in the dust of the road, and finally the Curse, the monster over which even your Great Magician would never be able to triumph.
#ANIMATION 73
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Deva  9
At-Zako saved me from certain death several times, and he left me only to avert the Curse from me, to make it chase himself! If you say anything bad about him again, I... will not leave here and you can go back to wherever you came from!
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  10
I must accept your decision, Lu-a-Jalla, and I swear you will never hear a bad word about your At-Zako from me again.
#CAMERA 10
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#phrase Hero  11
But he is going to hear an earful when we meet. And if that meeting does not end in a duel, he is an even worse coward than I think!
#DESC To himself

=== briefing Dr20
Talk to Dragon
#show Hero 4
#show SKD 1
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  1
Right, so here is the top of the mountain, and of course there is no Magician here - no one at all, in fact. Did I come all this way and not get any closer to my goal? That is bad...
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  2
But what is that noise? It sounds like... oh no, it is... a Dragon!!!
#show SKD 1
#show Hero 2
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  3
What is that? A human? What do you want here? Maybe you wish to fight me, according to an ancient custom? I have nothing against the old traditions, although frankly I cannot see any point in it...
#CAMERA 7
#phrase SKD  4
But I am not going to guess. It would be more fun if you tell me yourself. So?
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  5
I... uh... I did not expect to see you here, it was a mistake...
#DESC (We feel that hero is frightened, his throat is parched but he still manages to keep his dignity)
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  6
I believe you and agree with you. It is indeed a big mistake for a human to come to a Dragon's lair. But our little talk amuses me. I wonder if you could you tell me whom you expected to see here and why you came, little things like that, hmm,?
#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  7
I was hoping to find the Magician whom I saw in the Magic Orb... And since the Orb comes from Dead City here, I thought... the Magician might live here too and control the skeletons who guard him!
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  8
Well, sound enough reasoning - for a human, I suppose. But you need a Magician and you found me. And you were wrong about the skeletons too: occasionally I do control them, but very rarely and then purely for fun. So what do I do with you now?
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  9
Maybe you should not do anything with me... if you do not mind, I should like to leave and never bother you again...
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  10
Alas, that is not possible. As I said, I respect old traditions, and according to them you cannot just walk away. You have overcome many  dangers and put a lot of effort into your quest. You cannot simply throw it all away.
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  11
You could challenge me to a fight, you could demand that I free a maiden, and finally you could ask me to give you a job. If you do that, I would answer any question you may care to ask. I do not happen to have any maidens in captivity at this time and I can see that you are not too keen on the prospect of a fight. So that leaves us with a job for you. Are you ready?
#DESC Counting
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  12
Is this my chance at last? The Dragon said any question I may care to ask - so I could ask him who I am and where I come from? That would be worth risking my life for!
#DESC To himself
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  13
Yes, of course. I am all ears.
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  14
This area is full of caves. A lot of disgusting creatures which people call armadillos live and procreate in these caves. When night falls, their cubs rise to the surface and even get as far as my lair up here. They make a lot of noise and fuss, they fight for morsels of food - in a word, they irritate me.
#CAMERA 7
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  15
I am too huge to get into the cave, so you will go in there for me. I will give you a potion to poison the subterranean spring, so that all those who live downstream will bother me no more.
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  16
And do not leave the cave until you have killed the armadillo mother. My poison will not kill her, but it will weaken her. So even you, human, can finish her off. After that return here to me, where you may ask me a question. But think carefully before you ask, or you will regret it.
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 4
#phrase SKD  17
Though frankly I do not think that you could ask anything which might be really interesting.

=== briefing Dr22
Talk to Dragon
#show SKD 1
#show Hero 2
#CAMERA 1
#phrase SKD  1
I am pleased with you, human. So far everything has gone exactly as it should, according to the old traditions. You completed the task I set you. Now I am ready to answer your question.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  2
Oh wise Dragon! A misfortune has befallen me. I lost all memories of my past, I do not even know my real name. Could you tell me who I really am?
#DESC Solemnly, like a prepared speech
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  3
Hmm... Apparently I was wrong. It is an interesting question... and I am afraid that even I cannot answer it! So what is the appropriate thing to do in such a case? Do I have to eat the human? I would not like to do that...
#DESC Speaks loudly but to himself as if the hero was not there
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  4
Actually, I would not like it either...
#DESC To himself
#CAMERA 3
#phrase SKD  5
That is what we are going to do, then: I will tell you what I think about your problem, and you will have a chance to ask me another question. As to this one... Let us say I did not quite hear it.
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  6
So you want to have your memory back. To do that you will need a Magician, and not just any Magician - only a Great Magician would do. Of course there is a Great Magician here in Gipath, otherwise this land would have long since disappeared, along with everyone who lives here.
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  7
But apparently he is very secretive. Even I have no idea what he looks like and where he can be found. Maybe the Lizards know something about him - they were here long before the Dragons... but if you manage to come to an agreement with them, even I would be surprised.
#CAMERA 11
#phrase SKD  8
Probably you should leave Gipath and look for help in other lands. Maybe Great Magicians will not be so elusive there.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  9
Yes! I heard there was a Portal somewhere around here! So should I ask where it is?
#DESC Interrupting
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  10
Hmm... Frankly I was never interested in that. But there certainly is a Portal here. Recently I saw a camp set by people wearing real armor - not the leather favored by the locals. They were definitely from other lands, so methinks they would know about Portals!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  11
So where was that camp?
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase SKD  12
Aah, at last you ask a really sensible question. I saw the camp to the northeast of Dead City. There is a party of my skeletons there at the moment, but I will call them back.
#CAMERA 3
#phrase SKD  13
I have had good sport with those newcomers recently! I sent my little skeletons against their soldiers, but the soldiers actually proved to be a good match for them!
#DESC Not so much to the hero as to himself, reminiscing with gusto
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  14
So the people survived? I am sure you could have destroyed them!
#CAMERA 3
#phrase SKD  15
Of course I could. But when I play I play fair and respect the rules. And when you always win, it can become boring...
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 4
#phrase SKD  16
Farewell, human. I answered your question. Now you may leave.

=== briefing G42
About the missing girl
#show Hero 1
#show Huber 2
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  1
Governor! I am new in this city and I would like to make a request...
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  2
Young man, you are very lucky. I am in an excellent mood and have the inclination to do something good. So the first good deed I shall do for you is to give you a piece of advice.
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Huber  3
Never come to me without an appointment or before I ask to see you. I will forgive your insolence this time, but if this happens again I will call  the Guards and you will receive a sound lashing!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  4
But pray do not think I am cruel. On the contrary, in a way I am a liberal and have nothing against commoners but still, traditions are traditions. My duty is to enforce them, even if takes some unpopular measures!

=== briefing G43
About the arrow
#show Hero 1
#show Huber 2
#show Kapitan
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Huber  1
Hello young man! Your face looks familiar... oh yes, Tilvar told me about you! You seek the Princess, hmm? I sincerely wish you the best of luck. I wanted very much to... get better acquainted with her... but those rogue kidnappers got there first...
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  2
But according to the Captain you did manage to find something else, did you not?
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
Yes. I have the murder weapon...
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  4
Murder?
#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  5
The weapon which killed the Snoop from the capital. Here!
#show Hero 3
#show DriadArrow00 5
#show Huber 5
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  7
Eyes of a toad, it's beautiful! What an arrowhead! Wonderful workmanship...
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  8
I found the Snoop's body in the forest near the farm...
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  9
What body? Oh that body... Tell Tilvar, let him deal with it. I employ him so I don't have to listen to horrible stories myself.
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  10
But the arrow is really beautiful. Perhaps... oh, no, how disappointing! I already have one like that in my collection.
#hide DriadArrow00
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  11
Your collection is very famous.
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  12
And with good reason. I've collected a lot of very rare exhibits. I like young men who show proper respect to their elders. I'd be delighted to show you my exhibits.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Huber  13
I have very rare specimens here. Here is a Goblin sling, and this is an Orc axe. Have you ever seen an Orc, young man?
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  14
Who, me? No, of course not!
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Huber  15
Thought so. Aahh, the past, the past... I can see myself now... in the heat of battle, I kill one, then another and lead my troops... Ooohhh!
#show DriadArrow00 4
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Huber  16
But let us get back to our arrow...  Toad's curses! Where is my case with the Woodsfolk weapons?! It was the gem of my collection! Robbery! Treason!!! Get Captain Tilvar here immediately!
#hide DriadArrow00
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Kapitan  17
At your service, your Excellency.
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  18
What is happening in my province? Girls kidnapped in the city, people murdered in the woods and I - I! - robbed in my own home!
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 12
#phrase Kapitan  19
Mayhap if Madame Diera had not insisted that she put her magic traps where my men used to stand on guard outside your home, then...
#ANIMATION 43
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  20
I do not need your excuses! Everyone, out, out! And get those exhibits back!
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  21
If there was an arrow like that in the case, mayhap it was the one shot at the Snoop? Then I must find the thief.
#DESC To himself

=== briefing G53
About abandoned mines
#show Hero 1
#show Huber 2
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Huber  1
Ah, young man, why are you in such a hurry? What is the reason for all this haste?
#ANIMATION 43
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
The mine!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  3
What mine? What does it mean, "the mine"? And where is "Hello", where are your manners?
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
Your Excellency, I apologise for my haste but I have very serious reasons to speak with you. I decided it was time for me to see sense. To start business. Mining business.
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Huber  5
Oh, how unbearably dull... and what are those serious reasons?
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  6
Well, your Excellency, I noticed you love beauty and I am sure I can find a lot of wonderful things in the old abandoned mines...
#show Hero 3
#show GoldNugget00 4
#show Huber 5
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  7
like this nugget, for example. It would be an honor for me if you accepted it as a gift from me!
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 7
#hide GoldNugget00
#show GoldNugget00 5
#phrase Huber  8
Hmm... Well, those are indeed serious reasons, I would even say they are critical. I see you know your manners, and you have a romantic spirit too. Indeed, what can be more romantic than a lovely, heavy golden nugget!
#show Hero 1
#hide GoldNugget00
#show Huber 2
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  9
But to start business I will need the keys to the abandoned mines - and those keys are under your Excellency's control! I am sure I will find many other interesting things there, and the best of them may even deserve a place in your collection.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Huber  10
Oh, the key? Yes, I did have it somewhere... Well, if the lock is the only barrier between myself and beauty, how can I refuse you the key?

=== briefing Gl63
Talk to Khatul
#show Hero 3
#show Glav 4
#show Kuzn 5
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Kuzn  1
Brother Khatul! I found this blond man deep in the Black Cave. He says he managed to escape from the Canyon of Death, beaten up but not broken. He is worthy enough to become one of us!
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Glav  2
Are you not too trusting, Brother Blacksmith? Do you know how much gold has been promised to anyone who tells the Guards the secret of our subterranean shelter?
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Glav  3
Our guest does not look like an Aiset-Bek spy, but a snake is a snake whatever pattern is on its skin!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
The only thing I want from Aiset-Bek is to meet him armed, face-to-face.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 12
#phrase Kuzn  5
You can change your clothes, you can fake the scars from lashes... but you cannot fake the hate which burns in the eyes of this one. I cannot believe he lies, so I ask you to test him.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Glav  6
All right. So, Blondie, we will accept you as an equal... if you bring me the Emperor's Signet Ring. The messenger who had it was on the way to the Emperor's vizier in Suslanger... met a Cyclops, poor devil. We know that the Cyclops has the Ring among his treasures. Bring it here!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  7
And what will that prove? Mayhap I harm myself in your eyes when I say this...but anyone could do that, and with very different reasons too...
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 8
#phrase Kuzn  8
Brother Khatul, the trials in Death Canyon have clouded this man's mind! He even forgot what sort of punishment would face anyone who dared to touch the Emperor's Signet Ring, let alone steal it!
#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Glav  9
Brother Blacksmith, let this man decide for himself what he should do about the Ring. I will only tell him where he can find the Cyclops. So, Blondie, you will have to make your way to the Necromancers' desert and find a mountain ravine to the northwest.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Glav  10
The Cyclops lives there, and he is not alone: Evileyes are all around his den. You can kill or cheat Evileyes, but I would not advise you to try killing the Cyclops. And that is all I have to tell you!

=== briefing Gl64
Talk to Khatul
#show Hero 3
#show Glav 4
#show Kuzn 5
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Glav  1
I want to apologise for my harshness, brother! I hope there will not be any hard feelings between us because of that. Now you look like a bird from a shattered nest, but the Brotherhood of the Last Shelter can give you a new home and a new family.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Glav  2
And you may keep your past to yourself here. But it would be better if you could tell us at least briefly about yourself and how you happened to get into the Canyon.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
There is no secret about that. I am looking for a young man of the Joon race; the only thing I know about him is that he has reddish skin. I do not have any other business here in Suslanger and as soon as I find him we will go back to Gipath...
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  4
You call this area the Useless Lands but it is as close to home as I can get now, however strange that may sound.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Glav  5
I am sorry you will not join us. But I, Khatul, the first among equals in our brotherhood, respect your decision, so everyone who is able will help you in your quest!

=== briefing Gl64_3
About the killed slavedrivers
#show Hero 3
#show Glav 4
#show Kuzn 5
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 1
#phrase Glav  1
Even good deeds can lead to sad consequences, Brother Blondie. I do not have any regrets about the slavedrivers you killed, but you could have left traces which will bring the Guards to the Last Shelter!
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Glav  2
That did not happen and I forgive your insubordination. But please remember in future...consult with me or the other brothers before you embark on any other risky enterprise apart from your personal quest.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
But I acted on Brother Blacksmith's request!
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Glav  4
I will have a word with Brother Blacksmith and I hope he remembers what I shall tell him - and you too. Our position is too insecure here. I hope you understand me.
#ANIMATION 29
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  5
Yes, I understand you, but I cannot bypass every guard at a hundred paces! Sooner or later I will have to encounter them, it is inevitable!
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Glav  6
You are also right in a way, Brother Blondie. But if you start a fight you must win it and leave no enemies alive to tell the tale. Mayhap you should ask Brother Blind to give you some lessons... I will ask him to train you.

=== briefing Gl66
About the meeting with the owner of Joon antiques
#show Hero 1
#show Glav 2
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Glav  1
I know that you are going to meet a man from the city. Take some advice...however secluded your meeting place may be, still take a very good look around first. You know the old saying..."divine forces help those who do not forget to take precautions."
#ANIMATION 4
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Glav  2
Brother Blacksmith! Could you come over here?
#show Hero 3
#show Glav 4
#show Kuzn 5
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Glav  3
Could you tell Brother Blondie where you meet the merchants from the city?
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Kuzn  4
It is very easy to find. When you leave our catacombs and reach the city suburbs, go a short distance towards the sunrise and you will see a large wasteland surrounded by palm trees. That is the place, that is where I do business with the merchants.
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 12
#phrase Kuzn  5
Make sure no one sees you on the way! The guards may suspect nothing about the merchants' deliveries for the Brotherhood, but occasionally they do send patrols through the suburbs, just in case.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 1
#phrase Kuzn  6
Those patrols are never too strong, so if you stumble upon some guards it will be easier to kill them than to wait until they trot off somewhere else!

=== briefing Gl70
About the portal
#show Zaku 3
#show Hero 4 
#show Glav 5
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Glav  1
It is unfortunate that you wish to leave us, Brother. I hoped that you would be able to take my place after I go. Think about that.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
My mind is made up, Brother Khatul.
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Glav  3
Your journey will be dangerous: the Portal is guarded as if t'were the way to a treasure house of gold, and not just to the Useless Lands. But one of our Brothers does know how to get there. Brother Faceless, I rely on you! Brother Blondie is worthy of our assistance.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Zaku  4
Oh yes, Brother Khatul. In the northern foothills of the desert where the Portal is located there is a cave. We will meet there and I will show Brother Blondie how to obtain the key which opens the Portal and explain how to get past the patrols. I swear he will get everything he deserves!

=== briefing GoGo1
Giving the Goblin his "sacred object" back
#show Hero 
#show BGoblinC
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 1
