=== briefing Kr61
Talk to odalisque
#show Hero 1
#show Nalo 2
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 2 -30 10 10
#phrase Nalo  1
Listen carefully: northwest of the Canyon there is a passage which leads to a cave. Guards never enter it because they are afraid of the Wormheads, but I know for a fact that it also has other exits to the outside. When I let you out try to get there.
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 2 35 6 1.5
#phrase Nalo  2
My father hunted rats and often went to the caves... one day he did not return...this is what he told me.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 2 -30 7 7
#phrase Nalo  3
In the cave next to Death Canyon, the Lords of the Dungeons built their temple and two bridges across the lava rivers - the eastern and the western one. They are controlled by simple levers, so the main thing is to find them. You will have to go all the way through the cave from west to east; there must be a way out!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 2 35 6 1.5
#phrase Nalo  4
When I let you out take your things and go north to the main gates. Kardaur will be on duty today and he will have the key. Kill him, open the fortress and do not waste time - they will be after you very soon!
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 2 30 7 7
#phrase Nalo  5
You could hold them up for a while if you open all the cages in the zoo - they are right here in the southern fortress. There is a lever near the gates which opens all cages at once. I do not know why it is there, but I think the Guards must need it for one purpose or other.
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 2 0 3 0.8
#phrase Hero  6
I hope it is in good working order! And now thank you, sweetheart. I hope you find a more agreeable destiny...
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 2 35 6 1.5
#phrase Nalo  7
And I wish you luck too. Farewell now.

=== briefing Kuz64_1
About Blacksmith's work
#show Hero 3
#show Kuzn 5
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Kuzn  1
My story is as simple as a straight line in the sand. Apparently someone pushed my hand while the money-lender was giving me money - the very next day my smithy burnt like a bonfire! I am not an escaped slave because I escaped before they had a chance to enslave me.
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Kuzn  2
Some of the merchants in town still sell me materials and samples, so here in the Shelter we have weapons and protection. Of course we have to pay for this with good solid gold, but beggars cannot be choosers!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Kuzn  3
You will also have to pay me - so I can pay for the materials and the spells Brother Kehel makes for me.

=== briefing Kuz64_2
About the missing youth
#show Hero 3
#show Kuzn 5
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 1
#phrase Kuzn  1
I do not know anything about Joons - they lived too long ago. I always thought the stories about them were just fairy tales. I think you should look for a red-skinned young man in the Guards' dungeons - those dogs do not like people who look unusual in any way!
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Kuzn  2
And if in the process you finish off one or two more guards, that would be fine by me. And if that includes Lash-Aga and Whip-Aga, t'would be even better. They are brothers, and it would have been much better if their mother had died before she met their father!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
What strange names!
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Kuzn  4
Not names, but the nicknames people gave them...you can guess why. I have very old scores to settle with them, very old scores indeed. If I had not come here I would have found someone willing to rend the lash and break the whip! But on the other hand, I could ask you to do it, could I not?
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  6
You could ask, but I can promise nothing!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Kuzn  7
There is no need to make promises, I have not taken promises seriously for a very long time now... so I will just tell you how you can find Lash-Aga and Whip-Aga and you decide for yourself whether you can deal with them or not.
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Kuzn  8
As we speak, these two jackals torture the peons who work the plantations northeast of the city. One of the brothers supervises the central plantations, the other the southern ones. You will find it easily - there is a network of canals.
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Kuzn  9
Find and kill them! No one will miss them and I would be eternally grateful.

