=== briefing M1
About the Craftsman's work
#show Hero 1
#show Smith 2
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Smith  1
Oh no! Isn't that the Chosen? I suppose you are about to ask for something for nothing, are you not? Well, I will tell you this much: whoever you are, you will get nothing free from me, so there!
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  2
Now listen to me: I need your services, not your bad temper! No one will pay good money for that! The Elder told me that...
#ANIMATION 46
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Smith  3
I do not care what Chief Silvertongue told you. I never liked him anyway, and now I will not listen to him at all. Let him get my stuff back from them first!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
What stuff? Back from whom? Could you be more explicit?
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Smith  5
Seems clear enough to me. Them are them... "Free Hunters", that is what we are supposed to call them now. Ah, the Elder says they are our friends, but they have robbed me! My apprentice saw them and tried to stop them - so they gave him such a thrashing, the poor wee laddie could not work for two days!
#DESC The words "Free Hunters" pronounces with obvious disgust.
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Smith  6
In a word, they took away a lot, but most importantly my favorite tools. So before I get my stolen tools back, I cannot make anything!

=== briefing M1_1
More about the theft
#show Hero 1
#show Smith 2
#phrase Hero  1
I can see that you are a bit thrifty. If they had stolen your last penny I could understand your anger, but you do not look like a poor man to me!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Smith  2
Well, last penny or not, I still cannot be happy when they steal from me, can I? And secondly, I thought I already explained it. It is not about money, the point is, they stole my bodkin and my chisel!
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
Is that all? And I thought it was serious! Oh dear, this is a really big loss - a knife and a scraper!
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 7
