=== briefing R72_3
About the quest in Suslanger
#show Hero 3
#show Rick 4
#CAMERA 1
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  1
When I sent you to Suslanger I expected you to find friends there who would help you in your quest.
#CAMERA 11
