Sorry Brother, I hide my face because it has been disfigured by torture. I cannot help you in your quest now, but if there is anything I can do, I will do my best to see it through to its conclusion!

=== briefing S71
Talk to Faceless
#show Zaku 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Zaku  1
I am glad you decided to trust me, Brother Blondie! It will be a real pleasure to tell you everything I know about the Portal.
#DESC Speaks to the man with covered face
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Zaku  2
The Portal is located at the southeastern end of the desert, guarded by several guard units. Also, the approaches are secured by evil traps which burn anyone who steps on the Forbidden Territory. I suppose you could find the Guards who have the special keys to the traps and get past them, but...
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
But?
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Zaku  4
But that would be useless. The Portal only works when the two stone controls nearby are turned in the right direction. And to do that, you need one certain object which the Guards' commander always keeps on his person.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Zaku  5
To find him, you will have to pass through the city first via the western and then the southern bridge, and you must not raise the alarm. But I do not think you can do it, it is too fraught with danger!
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  6
Well! You probably do not know who I am! I really can move with stealth!
#ANIMATION 46
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Zaku  7
Oh, that is not what I meant at all! You will know what I mean very soon.
#DESC Compassionately, like "you silly boy, just wait a minute and I will explain everything to you..."

=== briefing S71_1
Treachery
#show Hero
#show Elder
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 1
#phrase Hero  1
You? How come you are here?!
#DESC Now speaking to the Elder
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
Simple, ha-ha! I was born here in Suslanger, and in your stinking Gipath I was only interested in one thing...
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
The meteorite? The same the Khadaganian expedition was on the lookout for?
#DESC Hero suddenly understands what it is all about
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  4
Ha-ha, you guessed right Chosen! I worked out where that fortune could be found before anyone else! I reached the Portal and travelled to Gipath. Oh, those poor naive villagers... They searched so hard for my meteorite and died... and they did not even know why!
#DESC With theatrical mocking admiration, about villagers- with false pity.
#ANIMATION 43
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  5
And you... You also were supposed to die but instead you managed to spoil everything for me. You got the upper hand then, but now is the time for revenge!
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  6
I did not lie to you - I really enjoyed telling you how to reach the Portal, and meanwhile the Guards whom I informed about you had just enough time to reach the cave exit. And my ultimate enjoyment will be when I watch you die, oh Great Chosen!
#DESC Exulted
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  7
But you still have a chance: fall on your knees and beg for mercy. Mayhap for the sake of the good old days in Gipath I will agree to save your life. But try to convince me with your wails and moans! Well? You may start!
#DESC Still exulted, making the most of his triumph
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  8
You forgot about one thing, Erfar. I have weapons, and even if the whole guard force comes at me, you will be the first one I kill!!!
#DESC Exaggeratedly calm, but we can feel his hate

=== briefing Sn67
Talk to Kholai
#show Hero 1
#show OldNekro 2
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  1
Oh your greatness! Would you be so kind in your eh... brilliant wisdom to eh... consider a request by a humble mortal? Your eh... distinguished appearance fills me with awe and admiration!
#ANIMATION 59
#CAMERA 11
#phrase OldNekro  2
Young man! Good flattery should be like a poisoned knife wrapped in silk... soft and tender with lethal poison inside. Few people can say they have mastered this art nowadays and you are definitely not one of them. So tell me in plain language what you want from me.
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  3
I need to talk to the spirit of one of the scientists whose dead bodies are stored in your former laboratory. And in return I am prepared to offer you Taivo's head - will that be enough?
