The dead man's spirit is ready to talk, young man. Be careful when you ask questions, and be doubly careful listening to the answers, because to talk to live people is torture for spirits and the conversation could be terminated any second!

=== briefing T42
About the missing girl
#show Hero 1
#show Trapper 2
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Trapper  1
It is a small town really, so everyone knows by now that you are one of those who searches for the Princess. So old Sver the Trapper will tell you this, sonny: it is good business to help a damsel in distress but it is also a dangerous one. There was another one before you who asked questions too. And he disappeared without a trace.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  2
So what happened to him? Do you know?
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Trapper  3
How would I know? He was a newcomer like you. They even say he came from the capital, a specialist who knew how to find missing people. A Snoop, in a word. So he sniffed around, looked at footprints through a round glass, made a lot of smoke with his pipe and said all sorts of clever words.
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Trapper  4
A city man but a sensible guy really, so he managed to uncover something. Last time I saw him he was so happy about something or other... but not for long, mind you - he went east of the city and that was the last we ever saw of him. I heard a rumor he was murdered...
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  5
But if you knew where he went why did you not try to find him?
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Trapper  6
I do not want to know, my dear fellow; I must think about number one, always.  Our local villain merchant Karansul lowered skin prices again. So I have to move to make ends meet!
#hide Trapper
#show Hero 4
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  7
Hmm... the Snoop obviously did not disappear by chance. Mayhap if I solve this mystery, I will get a clue which would take me to the Princess?
#DESC To himself

=== briefing T44
How to put pressure on Karansul
#show Hero 1
#show Trapper 2
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Trapper  1
Well guy, you helped me and now I will do what I promised. I will give you a share in my profits and tell you what I know. Karansul is tremendously rich. We cannot even imagine how rich.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  2
So where did those riches come from?
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Trapper  3
No surprises there! He owns mines, pits, sawmills and the list goes on... and he pays about one tenth of the taxes he should rightfully pay. He makes a lot of money, sells directly to the capital, and the Governor gets nothing - I tell you this in confidence.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Trapper  5
The Governor trusts Karansul. He knows how to talk civilly and sometimes gives the Governor some stuff for his collection. But no one has ever had a look at his accounting ledgers.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  6
You mean no evidence - no crime, is that it?
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Trapper  7
That is correct. Just one look at his accounts would tell us what and how much has been sold illegally... But Karansul's bodyguards are no joke. No, you can see it but you cannot get it.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  8
But I can try, can I not?
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Trapper  9
Open your ears! The mines foreman carries the accounting book with him. The mines and sawmills in Karansul's domain are located around the lake. On the northeastern lake shore there are two important buildings - the foreman's house and the mechanical grinder. Now that machine cost him an arm and a leg, and a really clever apparatus it is!...
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Trapper  11
But that is not the point. That is how to find the foreman's house: it has two short chimneys on the roof. Just make sure you do not confuse it with the Guards' canteen, for it also has two chimneys but they are longer.
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Trapper  12
And two last things: first, ask the Captain about Karansul's business. Tell him some tale, like you have hardly any money left and you need work. Maybe then you can squeeze something useful out of him! And secondly, find a man by the name of Trickster in the city and tell him hello from me.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  13
And then what?
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Trapper  14
I do not know, really. You see, Trickster is a thief but a good man too. Maybe he will give you some advice, some professional secrets... Just tell him you came from me!

