=== briefing V3_1
Talking about the Captain's plan
#show Hero 1
#show Sheriff 2
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Sheriff  1
Right, what I propose is to give the Goblins a taste of their own medicine. We will not be able to deal with the whole tribe, but if we skin about seven or eight of them, it would be just the ticket.
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
And then what?
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Sheriff  3
But the whole village is full of the news that the Chosen wishes to punish the Goblins for their raid.
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  4
Is that so?! Where did they get that idea?
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Sheriff  5
The Elder told them so. See, I was about to send my men to deal with it, but if you want to do it - they do not mind, they are not proud. They would be happy to sit at home.
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  6
Oh right... I see. And what if I change my mind, eh?
#ANIMATION 7
