#ANIMATION 30
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  8
Yes, I would think so... Well, thanks very much Erfar, and thanks very much to you, Gort. I will remember your kindness.
#DESC (At first annoyed, then nastily)
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Sheriff  9
So we have an agreement then! But one more thing: you better not touch the Orcs, just hit the Goblins. Orcs are much stronger and they have got a Seer in the Foothills - now that is a Magician, not like our Witch!

=== briefing V4
About the cave bridge mechanism
