=== briefing Vo64
About the missing youth
#show Hero 1
#show Merc10 2
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Merc10  1
Oh, what a pity! I would love a look at that red-skinned young man. Is he very beautiful? I would like to steal such a one, though I usually only steal objects and money!
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
I have only seen one Joon in my life and that was a girl. She really was the most beautiful person I ever saw!
#ANIMATION 66
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Merc10  3
You are in love with her, and she is not with you? Do not deny it! I will give you good advice: stop your search for the young Joon man. She will be sad for a while but then she will start to look at you. The female heart is fickle and well I know it!
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  4
I promised to find him. Promised, you understand?
#ANIMATION 64
#CAMERA 3
