My name is too long, but you can call me Rinas. As to my talent... I am not a bad sorcerer, but since Magician Diera came to the city other Magicians find it rather difficult to compete. The Governor forbade us to practice - all except that albino.
#ANIMATION 43
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Merc5  4
No, I will not reduce myself to cheap bickering. Let us put it this way: that very calculating and not overly squeamish woman.
#ANIMATION 30
