=== briefing r36
About the Great Magician
#show Rick 1
#show Hero 2
#CAMERA 1
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase Rick  1
I expected you, you who is called Chosen!
#DESC (Sonorous, impressive, even solemn)
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
Are you... do you know me?
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  3
Your unusual arrival attracted my attention, and  when you managed to peer into the Magic Orb my interest increased even more. My Dragonet accompanied you everywhere, and as far as I can tell, you noticed it too - occasionally. The closer you got to success, the more I looked forward to this meeting.
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  4
But who are you? What is your name? And if you are so powerful that you could watch me without leaving your cave, could you help me with my problems? I probably do not have to tell you about them - I am sure you know everything...
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase Rick  5
You ask too many questions too quickly, without aforethought... what if I were to answer them in the same way? However, your curiosity will be satisfied - partly.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  6
My name would sound to you like Tka-a-Litan Rich-ty-a-Nik. An impatient person like you would probably find it somewhat long, so you may call me simply Tka-Rik. You may also add the words "Great Magician" to my name, though I have no need for such solemn title.
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  7
I could help you with your problem, but... we shall come to a certain agreement. I will also need your help.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  8
You? A Great Magician? You joke!
#CAMERA 7
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase Rick  9
Oh no, this is not the time for jokes. Everything in this world has its price, and I always pay in full. No Great Magician has a right to leave his island - so I am chained to this desolate Gipath. And that is why I need a person who can accomplish certain missions in other lands.
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  10
You will have to find and bring here two young people, a man and a girl. They, like myself, belong to a once great race of Joons, and I must... But I will tell you all that later, if you are interested. Now tell me, do you agree or not?
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  11
Hm... As if you do not know the answer. 'Course I agree!

=== briefing r36_1
More about the Canian Empire
#show Rick 1
#show Hero 2
#CAMERA 1
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  1
When the world was whole, Gipath was just a small corner of a vast continent. After the Joons' power vanished, other states appeared here...
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase Rick  2
The Night of Troubles which splintered the world destroyed those states. There are even fewer traces of them than there are of the long-forgotten Joons. Only two Empires managed to survive the Night of Troubles, the two eternal rivals - Cania and Khadagan.
#CAMERA 7
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  3
Cania, whither you will soon go, seems to me to be a country where the rulers are not especially cruel and the subjects feel relatively free. Do not succumb to the temptation to relax, always use caution there!

=== briefing r36_2
Start the quest in Ingos
#show Rick 1
#show Hero 2
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  1
Now I will use my magic and send you to Ingos. This amulet will help you to return here, but will work only when you have found the girl!
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 5
#phrase Rick  2
Get ready - you will now feel dizzy, and when you come to your senses you will be in a different land. My Dragonet will accompany you... and may your good luck also be with you there!

=== briefing r36_3
About the Joon race
#show Rick 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  1
Joons... these proud and beautiful people with reddish skins were masters of this world in ancient times. The ruins of colossal buildings and dusty statues so plentiful here in Gipath are but puny traces of their former glory. I, a Joon Magician, who lived on after my fellow Joons perished, could also be called a remnant of that bygone world.
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  2
You called me powerful... Hmm... One should not tempt Great Forces with such talk: there is always something compared to which any power is no more awesome than a moth compared to a Dragon. My powers did not save our race from extinction, nor this world from catastrophe.
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  3
Why did I decide that I can ask you, a simple mortal, for help? The answer is easy.
#CAMERA 7
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  11
You are brave because you disregarded danger. You are strong because you managed to defeat many enemies. And you are lucky because without luck all the bravery and force in the world are worth nothing. Now listen!
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  12
For many centuries I thought I was the last Joon in the world. I did not live, I simply passed the remaining time of my existence. But very recently I felt the presence of other Joons: a young man and a girl, both full of life! And so it was revealed what my mission in life was to be...I was to guard Gipath, ready for that moment when the Joon race will be resurrected here!
#CAMERA 7
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  13
Alas, the young people are within my perception but outside of the limits of my power. So that is why I need an assistant...to bring them here. A strong, brave and lucky assistant. I have sought a suitable emissary for a long time - and now I have found you.
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  14
So prepare yourself for a journey, my friend: you will have to go to Ingos which now belongs to a state called the Canian Empire. There you must find the girl of my race and bring her to Gipath. And you will know everything else in due time!

=== briefing r36_4
About the forthcoming quest
#show Rick 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  1
So I am about to travel to another land... strange... I was anxious to leave Gipath for such a long time, but now I feel more apprehension than anticipation!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
But never mind. I have friends here in Gipath who will help me wherever I happen to be!
#CAMERA 11
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  3
Alas, my friend, I must disappoint you: your friends will not be able to help you.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  4
Oh? You may be a great Magician but it seems you do not know human nature very well!
#CAMERA 3
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  5
Again you jump to conclusions...just listen to what I have to say. What I mean is this: you must go to that land alone. No one can accompany you!
#ANIMATION 6
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  6
What a shame! We have been through a lot together... I did not think we would have to part so soon!
#CAMERA 9
#ANIMATION 6
#phrase Rick  7
I am sorry but it is the only way. So say goodbye to them...

=== briefing s0
About the village
#show Hero 1
#show Elder 2
#ANIMATION 3
#phrase Hero  1
I understand that you are the Elder of this village?
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  2
Yes. I am Elder Erfar. The people of this village entrusted me to govern them. Sometimes they call me Silvertongue, but I do not mind. I take this as a sign of respect.
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
Is that so? The master of this land allows people to choose who should rule them? I wonder how your king feels about that...
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  4
Alas, Chosen, we have no master and no king. No one has use for such a desolate land as Gipath. The village exists alone, and we know not how to reach other lands.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  5
So one could say I am indeed the leader here and must make all decisions. It is a task both difficult and demanding, but I bear my cross for the sake of my people! The good Captain here is always here to aid me. And I can proudly say that we have good order here, no worse than any king could establish.
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  6
But what about the other villages - do they manage on their own too?
#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  7
There are no other villages. Ours is the only one in Gipath. A very long time ago a forgotten people lived here, but now only ruins and abandoned roads are left, with Goblins and Orcs all around us.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  8
I see... Well, that is quite a surprise. I must think about it.
#NOLIPS
#show Hero 4
#ANIMATION 30
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  9
Merciful Heavens! What is this place, what has happened to me?! I know I was not born here - but where, then? I feel I was supposed to do something, but what? I must find out, but who could help me?!!
#DESC To himself

=== briefing s1
The meeting in the village
#show  Hero 0 weapon
#show Elder
#show Sheriff
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#phrase Hero  1
Oh dear! Looks like the whole village is here!
#DESC To himself
#ANIMATION 29
#CAMERA 8
#phrase Sheriff  2
Right, everyone here? Quiet, now! The Elder is going to speak!
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  3
My people! Today is a great day for our village! We all remember the legend about the Chosen One who should appear at the Sacred Ruins - and now behold, here he is in the flesh!
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
Hmm, actually I did see some ruins when I came back to my senses... Does that mean I am really a Chosen One?
