Even if Estera's granddaughter did come to the village, no one saw her... But I do not think she would come here, her grandmother is really not popular!

=== briefing s12
About the trip to Gold Valley
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 5
