I put all my hopes on you, Chosen, as did the other villagers, but t'was all in vain! The Captain had to find another man who managed to bring us the gold. I hope you will not be upset, though I personally would feel very ashamed in your shoes!

=== briefing s12_4
About a new expedition against Goblins
#show Hero
#show Sheriff
#show Elder
#ANIMATION 9
#phrase Elder  1
Because Redhead was killed, the Free Hunters were very upset with you, Chosen, but I managed to explain to them that you acted with the best of intentions. So to show their good will, they told us that the Goblins are planning another raid. We agreed that the Free Hunters and Gort's soldiers would strike the Goblins first. I would appreciate it were the Chosen to take part in that enterprise too.
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2 0 2.2 2
#phrase Hero  2
Will anyone ever ask me what I would like to do? But all right, I could do that - Goblins do not worry me unduly.
#DESC To himself
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  3
All right, I will do it.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Sheriff  4
Wonderful! The Goblins gather as we speak at the western edge of the swamps, near the river hillocks. But first you will need to see the Chieftain's lieutenant. He will wait for you where the road to the river begins.
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  6
Alone?
#ANIMATION 29
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Sheriff  7
Of course! And unarmed! Others will cover the approaches to the meeting point. You are perhaps aware that these are cruel lands, so the men will use utmost caution. When you arrive at the meeting point, there will be a nice little party!
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  8
But do not tell Babur about it. You may be friends with him but do remember that he would do anything for money!
#ANIMATION 7
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2 0 2.2 2
#phrase Hero  9
I do not like the smell of this... I can even pinpoint what is wrong... The Brigands were too quick to forgive me! On the other hand, perchance the Elder really did come to an agreement with them? His words could sweeten the breath of a horned toad!
#DESC To himself
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2 0 2.2 2
#phrase Hero  10
It is as clear as mud, as they say. So I should watch my step!
#DESC To himself

=== briefing s12_5
New briefing
#show Hero 
#show Elder
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  1
So where is our poor Go-Go? Where did he go?
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
I ordered him kicked out of here. He did no harm, but I was tired of him. And we should throw away that "Goblin sacred object" too - it is no use to us now.

=== briefing s13_0
About treason
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  1
All right, my friend. Either you tell me exactly what is happening, or else!
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
What do you mean? What happened?
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
Your Brigand friends attacked me, that is what happened, and Gort's men helped them in their task!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  4
Treason? That is impossible! If that is true, I will tell Gort not to let the traitors back to the village, and later we will deal with them properly.
#ANIMATION 29
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  5
I will cut their throats myself for this!
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  6
That is your right. But, alas, you will not prevent the Goblin raid by doing so...

=== briefing s13_1
About the Middle Mountains Lizards
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
The Middle Mountains are dangerous nowadays, though a while ago it was quite different. Humans used to have an understanding with the Lizards who live there. They even put a sign of peace on their altar to show the way was open  - a big Shell.
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  2
But a short time ago the Shell disappeared - and the Middle Mountains became dangerous again!

=== briefing s13_2
About the ambush
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
Oh Chosen! I'm so happy you're alive. A monstrous mistake, unforgivable nonchalance, a tragic chain of events, a fateful coincidence...
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
Another coincidence? Too many of those, perchance?
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  3
I tried to get to the bottom of it but I have no evidence against the Craftsman though I am sure it's all his fault!

=== briefing s13_3
About the letter in Orc language
#show Elder 3
#show Instruction4orcs00 4
#show Hero 5
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  1
I am sick of these blind accusations! I will not make another move until I find out what is wrong here. Here is the Orc note, and I seem to remember that you can read those scribbles. So read!
#ANIMATION 30
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  2
Eh... mmm... well, in a word, it says that they want to kill you and that there is a fat reward for your killer! And it also says... ehh... the Elder, that is me, must never know about it.
#hide Instruction4orcs00
#show Instruction4orcs00 5
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  3
Yes, it is now clear to me, Babur is behind it! That is where the stolen gold surfaced! What other evidence do we need? Now I shall call the Captain and we will finally teach that two-faced traitor a good lesson!
#hide Instruction4orcs00
#show Instruction4orcs00 4
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  4
No, hold! I do not understand the situation yet.

=== briefing s19
About instructions to kill the Chosen
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
Good heavens, it is the Captain's handwriting! So that is who our enemy was, that is who wanted to start a quarrel between you and me! But that definitely was not his own doing, he's too stupid for that. I see another hand in this! But Gort still deserves severe punishment!

=== briefing s1_3
About the killed Goblin
#show Hero 1
#show Elder 2
#ANIMATION 31
#phrase Elder  1
I am in your debt, Chosen! And I thank you on behalf of the other villagers too! Now we can take our remaining animals to pastures without fear of Goblins. And if the heavens show some mercy we can at least keep a small herd. I certainly hope so...
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
I do not understand, Erfar. There is no danger of Goblins now but you talk as if you were about to lose your last pig!
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  3
It is not only Goblins, but also wolves who attack our herd every night. But perhaps, Chosen,  you could deal with the wolves too?
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  4
Do you expect me to run after miserable wolves? That is a job for a shepherd dog, not for me!
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  5
These wolves are far from miserable, Chosen! The pack who steals our pigs is no ordinary pack, and its leader, the White Wolf, is more cunning than any dog... How many times has he eluded our Hunters! Only you, Chosen, could outwit that beast. Your intelligence and cunning will give the White Wolf no chance at all!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  8
Hm... All right.  But would not that little Dragon scare the White Wolf off before time? I saw a little glittering Dragon several times here in Gipath. And every time he came just when something was about to happen!
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  9
I do not know of this dragon, Chosen. Perhaps you can see more than we mere mortals.
#DESC With sincere surprise

=== briefing s21
About the Captain
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
At last we have rid ourselves of the traitor thanks to our Chosen! How blind I was, how naive... But I will not be so blind in the future. I cannot believe that Gort acted alone, no matter how despicable he may be. There must be someone else!

=== briefing s21_1
About the new threat to the village
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 44
#phrase Elder  1
I became aware of a new and horrible trouble! Gort paid the Orc Seer and he cast an illness on the village! There is only one medicine which can cure it - the White Flower healing plant. It can be found to the southeast of Middle Mountains.
#show Elder 3
#show DriadIdol01 5
#show Hero 5
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
I beg of you, do not waste time and bring it to me!
#hide DriadIdol01 5
#show DriadIdol01 4
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  3
The flower grows in the Middle Mountains. Take the road east, and when you see hills to the north, go through the pass there. Behind those hills you will find the magic plant!

=== briefing s24
About the trip for the Flower
#show Elder 3
#show DriadIdol01 4
#show Hero 5
#phrase Hero  1
Here is the Flower!
#hide DriadIdol01
#show DriadIdol01 5
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
I do not know how I can express my gratitude! Yet again, the Chosen saves our village from certain death! Fortunately no one fell ill yet, so your assistance came right on time!
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  3
Well I am glad I could do a good deed, but now let us move on to less pleasant matters. Tell me why the flower was guarded by the Orcs, as if they knew in advance that someone would come for it?
#hide DriadIdol01
#show DriadIdol01 4
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  4
Well, why not think about this? Who was it who did not want you to bring the flower to me? T'was Babur and no one else.

=== briefing s24_2
