Erfar, I was thinking. We should protect the village from possible illnesses in the future. The Witch told me that there is another magic flower in the Middle Mountains, next to Babur's old quarry - where his old cart lies.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
I intend to go there as soon as possible! But keep this between you and me for now.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 11
