=== briefing s25_3
Demand to translate the document
#show Elder 3
#show CodedHadaganNote 4
#show Hero 5
#ANIMATION 1
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  1
All right, cur, I will give you one chance to make your future a bit brighter. Just a little brighter, mind you, but better than nothing for someone in your situation.
#hide CodedHadaganNote
#show CodedHadaganNote 5
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
You can translate this paper, right?
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  3
Of course, of course! Right away!
#ANIMATION 7
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  4
And I trust I need not warn you about any mistakes, deliberate or otherwise?
#hide CodedHadaganNote
#show CodedHadaganNote 4
#ANIMATION 31
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  5
No, no, Chosen, I understand that I am in your hands!
#hide CodedHadaganNote
#show CodedHadaganNote 5
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  6
This is the official alphabet of the Khadaganian Empire, and this paper is a kind of draft report. A unit... several soldiers and an official... A camp... A new camp near the Remote Mountains... And here is a coherent passage: it says that in the eastern part of the Remote Mountains there is a narrow passage in the rocks leading to the north. Oh, and that it leads to a dead end where there is a lever.
#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  7
That lever is connected with a tunnel to the west of the ravine. If you press this lever it opens the entrance to the tunnel! The passage is winding and dangerous, crevices and dead ends are mentioned here...  It says that it is dangerous to venture too far to the east - Harpies live there.
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  8
Is that it?
#ANIMATION 2
#CAMERA 7
