No, there is more... there is danger inside the tunnel, but it does not specify what kind of danger. That is all it says.
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  10
Ha! Did you really hope that I would let you go in exchange for this nonsense? No, you will stay here until I decide what to do with you!

