=== briefing s6
About the fight with the Redhead
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 14
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
You will not like my words, but I must tell you that you have erred greatly, Chosen! Do you not see that you have played into the Craftsman's hands? You have intensified the fued between the villagers and the Free Hunters.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  2
Yes, that is what I wanted to talk about. I do not know about the Craftsman, but I saw the Redhead in pleasant conversation with an Orc, saw him with my own eyes! 
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  3
What? How can that possibly be?! Of course, I must trust the word of the Chosen... But tell me, was it the Craftsman who spoke such?
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
Yes it was. So what?
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  5
You are so naive, Chosen!  You did not discern his true plans. He wanted to use you to get rid of the one witness whom he himself induced to become a traitor. I beg of you, talk to me first if this happens again. Then perhaps you will see things in a different light.

=== briefing s6_1
About the Magic Orb
#show Hero 1
#show Elder 2
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  2
I have heard something about that thing and I will try to remember what it was... but we have much more important business to attend to, do we not, Chosen?

=== briefing s6_2
The Elder's important business
#show Hero 1
#show Elder 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
Oh Chosen! I put together all the rumors, legends and lore of our village elders and came to an amazing conclusion - our island is not so isolated as it seems. We must find out if this is indeed true, and if you could find a way to communicate with other lands - with my humble assistance, of course - our village would be tremendously happy...
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2 0 2.2 2
#phrase Hero  2
Oh!... Well, I am sure that in other lands I could find really powerful Magicians who would restore my memory! It would be much easier just to go through a Portal over there than to run all over this devastated land of Gipath!
#DESC To himself
#show Hero 1
#show Elder 2
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  3
So tell me!
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  4
There is a Chief of a small Goblin tribe named GoGo. He has a blue stone where one of his eyes should be. I heard that in ancient times that they used to make Portals out of such material, and those Portals could transport people from one place to another in a split second. If we could find out where that stone came from, then I could tell whether or not we have such a Portal in Gipath or not.
#ANIMATION 5
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  5
An excellent idea! But where do I find that... what's his name... GoGo?
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  6
He will come to us himself and tell us everything he knows. GoGo's tribe worships the First Goblin; they still have his skull. If we lay our hands on that sacred object, GoGo would do anything to get it back! This is what it looks like...
#show Hero 3
#show Elder 5
#show GoblinFright00 5
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  7
One would have to be a Goblin to worship such a... eh... sacred object!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  8
But please - not a word about the Portal before we find it. No need to give the people false hopes!
#hide Elder 
#hide GoblinFright00 4
#show Hero 4
#ANIMATION 30
#NOLIPS
#CAMERA 2 0 2.2 2
#phrase Hero  9
As if I would repeat this to anyone! The first thing I shall do is to use that Portal myself, and that will be the last they ever see of me. Mayhap not... after all, they do seem to pin all their hopes on me... Aaaahhh!... This village existed for a hundred years without a Chosen, so they will easily survive another hundred without one!
#DESC To himself

=== briefing s6_3
More about the Elder's plan
#show Hero 3
#show Elder 5
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
The tribe ruled by GoGo live near the Lake where the big river forms a delta with many islands. You will not be able to reach the islands, nor will you need to: the Goblin settlement is on this side of the river, between the swamp and the river bank.
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
And remember: Goblins have a feud with the Lizards. Maybe you will find some way to benefit from that.

=== briefing s7_1
Interrogate GoGo together with the Elder
#show bGoblinC 4
#show Elder 3
#show Hero 5
#CAMERA 9
#phrase bGoblinC  1
Me come ask ya give First Goblin back. And for that me not steal any pig two three week. Swear my Blue Eye Stone!
#ANIMATION 46
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Elder  2
What kind of oath is that? What do I care about your stone - maybe you found it in the dirt and now you are making an oath on it.
#CAMERA 11
