=== briefing s8_1
About the quest for the Portal
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  1
Alas, I gather that the quest for the Portal is hopeless. Apparently it is somewhere on the Orc islands, and humans cannot get there. I cannot say how sad I feel about this all...

=== briefing s8_2
About the islands and the Portal
#show Elder 1
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 1
#phrase Hero  1
Listen, Erfar! I do not understand you: first you say that we have important business and then you forget all about it? I got that "hide with letters" GoGo told us about!
#show Elder 3
#show OrcLicense00 5
#show Hero 5
#ANIMATION 32
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  2
Oh Chosen! Did you really manage to get to the islands and come back alive?! That is a truly great deed! And now wait, I shall try to read what it says... by the way, did you see anything unusual on the islands? Mayhap a strange piece of rock similar in color to GoGo's eye?
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  3
Is that what the Portal is supposed to look like? No matter, because I never saw anything like that. Tell me what the hide says!
#hide OrcLicense00
#show OrcLicense00 4
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  4
Unfortunately, nothing of value to us. Apparently I was wrong! What a disappointment...
#show Elder 1
#hide OrcLicense00 4
#show Hero 2
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Elder  5
Of course we shall continue our quest for the Portal, but now, oh Chosen, I must ask for your help in another matter. I cannot find our gold - all the money our poor people paid as taxes! And Babur's apprentice disappeared from the village that same night. Apparently the Craftsman weaves his intrigues yet again - he wants to be the master of the whole village!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 6
#phrase Hero  7
So what can I do? Rush after the thief?
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Elder  8
I am afraid even you will not find him. However, there is another way around the problem. There is a place in Gipath where a very rich caravan met with death a long time ago, during a time when another race inhabited these lands. People in the village know about it, but only I know exactly where that gold can be found.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Elder  9
I never revealed that secret to anyone, lest that lowly Babur grab it all. The way there is a bit dangerous but to you it would be just a walk.
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Elder  10
The place is called Golden Valley, in that part of Gipath which borders the Dead City. To the northwest is a river loop; the valley lies on the eastern bank, about the middle of the river. If you could bring us the contents of at least one coffer, the village would be saved! But I beg of you, do not tell this secret to anyone.

