=== briefing z13_1
Airy's news
#show Daughter 5
#show Witch 3
#show Hero 4
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Witch  1
Look, Chosen, here she is! Just came in as if nothing ever happened! She should thank her lucky stars that she actually managed to find out something useful, otherwise I would give her a good thrashing, the impudent scallywag! But all in good time... all right you shameless creature, tell the Chosen everything, exactly as you told me.
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Daughter  2
