#CAMERA 4
#phrase Witch  6
There is no need for sarcasm! That is what I was going to suggest!
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Daughter  7
Of course I cannot tame Dragons, but I saw how Lizards do it! They have a special amulet, and if the bearer of that amulet nears a Dragon, it will not attack, but instead will follow that person! But the amulet only works with one special Dragon!
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 7
#phrase Daughter  8
And I also know where you can find the Lizard who has that amulet: he went to the old quarry in the Middle Mountains. He keeps two tame toads there - uh they are so fat and ugly...
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 2
#phrase Hero  9
All right, all right. Let us suppose I get that amulet. Then where do I find that special Dragon?
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 1
#phrase Daughter  10
The Dragon lives across the lake... If you wait for winter, you can just walk across the ice... but now, in summer, t'will be awfully hard for you to find your way along the shore!
#DESC Regretfully
#ANIMATION 9
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Witch  11
Tis you who can wait until winter, you silly goose! The Chosen can get there now - with my help, of course. To the north of Dead City is a ravine with green crystals. Crystals are closely related to ice, you know. Bring one to me and I will freeze the lake as if it were winter!
#ANIMATION 29
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Daughter  12
I will get the crystal!
#ANIMATION 3
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Witch  13
Be still, chatterbox! I will never let you out of my sight again! Let the Chosen go and fetch that crystal - if he wants to, that is.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 5
#phrase Hero  14
I see! So to get into the Dead City I need to get to the Observatory. To get into the Observatory I need a tame Dragon. To tame the Dragon I need the amulet. And to get close to the Dragon I need a green crystal... that is about the size of it, is it not? So now all is perfectly simple - just go and fetch all that stuff!

