Now, now, listen, an ABC Book is a totally different matter. Right... right... well, congratulations, Chosen, a wolf hunt is under way, and you are the wolf! A detailed description of you has been left in a secret place for the Orcs to find  - where you go, the company you keep, what weapons you use, all that. And so much gold is on offer, that maybe only Babur would have anything like that amount. About as much as has been stolen from the Elder! Apparently you are highly valued!
#ANIMATION 45
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  2
But who could be so interested in me?
#ANIMATION 32
