#ANIMATION 8
#CAMERA 3
#phrase Witch  5
You know the way to the river, do you not? Remember it starts in a small valley?
#ANIMATION 15
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  6
Yes, of course! The road goes between two hills to the south.
#ANIMATION 44
#CAMERA 9
#phrase Witch  7
And that secret place is on the other side of the hill, to the east. But remember, when the Orcs get that paper with your description on it, they will not tarry in wait for you. If you are late, you will have to go to the Council Mountain. Orcs usually discuss their most important business on its summit, and they would certainly consider teaching the Chosen a lesson just for the fun of it!

