#CAMERA 9
#phrase Witch  11
You take the mechanism from the caretaker, lower the bridge, cross the river and you are almost in Shei-Var's house. Just use your wits when you talk to him, and do not be mean if it comes to paying ransom. I will pay you everything back, with interest!

=== briefing z41_1
About Estera's granddaughter, saved
#show Hero
#show Daughter
#show Witch
#ANIMATION 61
#CAMERA 4
#phrase Witch  1
Now that is what I call a nasty, shameless girl - people risk their lives to save her and not even a thank you! But never mind, I will make it worth your while.
#ANIMATION 63
#CAMERA 12
#phrase Witch  2
Do not be so sceptical, it is a very rare thing! And I have another request - will you talk to that damn girl? She has not been herself at all.
#DESC Shows item
#hide Witch 
#show Hero 1
#ANIMATION 11
#CAMERA 11
#phrase Daughter  3
Why can you not look at me even now? What is wrong with me?
#DESC (Guiltily but challenging)
#ANIMATION 62
#CAMERA 10
#phrase Hero  4
It is not you, Airy, it is me. You see... although I do not remember my past, I still can feel something in my heart. I know, I... I feel that I love another person and that she waits even now for me! But I cannot remember where she is or how to find her. You are a very nice girl, Airy, but I will neither cheat you nor anyone else. And please, do not do any more foolish things. Next time I may not arrive in time.

